            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.7

- Redesigned the volume control around the current macOS HUD: output-device name, precise level rail, and a dedicated mute end-cap.
- Made the volume reveal and return substantially faster, with a concise system-style expansion from the ellipsis.
- Improved update-feed caching for new installs.
]]></description>
