            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.6

- Added a longer, gradual next-cover dissolve during the final seconds of queued YouTube Music tracks.
- Refined the volume control into a reflective liquid-glass capsule that grows from and compresses back into the ellipsis.
- Fixed the volume popover’s closing geometry so the return animation is reliably visible.
]]></description>
